        "text": "=Hello {{ $('Prepare the payment').item.json.firstName }},\n\nYou can pay invoice {{ $('Prepare the payment').item.json.invoiceNumber }} ({{ $('Prepare the payment').item.json.amount }} {{ $('Prepare the payment').item.json.currency }}) in Bitcoin, USDT, Ethereum, Solana and more:\n{{ $json.chargeLink }}\n\nChoose your coin on the page and send the exact amount shown. The invoice is marked paid automatically once the payment is confirmed.\n",
