    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Get paid in crypto for Invoice Ninja invoices\n\n### How it works\nWhen you create an invoice in Invoice Ninja, this workflow creates a CigalPay checkout for the amount due and emails your client a payment link. They pay in Bitcoin, USDT, Ethereum, Solana or another coin. When CigalPay confirms the payment, the second part checks it covers the balance in the invoice currency and records the payment in Invoice Ninja, which marks the invoice paid. Anything that doesn't match is emailed to you instead.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-cigalpay** (Settings \u2192 Community Nodes, tested with 1.1.0). Unverified community nodes need self-hosted n8n.\n2. Create an **Invoice Ninja** credential (v5: your Invoice Ninja URL and an API token from Settings \u2192 Account Management \u2192 API Tokens) and a **CigalPay API** credential (CigalPay dashboard \u2192 Settings \u2192 API credentials).\n3. Add an SMTP credential to both email nodes.\n4. Edit **Set your settings** and **Set your email**. Clients must be invoiced in USD or EUR; invoices up to 5,000 are offered.\n5. Activate the workflow, copy the **CigalPay Trigger** production URL into notificationUrl, then save.\n\n### Customization\nSend the link by SMS or chat instead of email, or only for invoices above an amount.\n",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "233c09e4-4032-59b9-8654-4cfdf865f7bf",
      "name": "Sticky Note main",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send the payment link\nA new invoice gets a CigalPay checkout for the amount due, in the client's currency, and the client gets the link by email.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 1560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "f4fc609f-315b-58f2-8af4-e3148da57c86",
      "name": "Sticky Note send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Record the payment\nOnly an unpaid invoice is updated, so the CONFIRMED and FINISHED notifications record one payment. The paid amount must cover the balance in the invoice currency.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 1560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "2efab85e-0054-5ef6-85c7-9aa3f457c50c",
      "name": "Sticky Note record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        380
      ]
    }
